{'symbol': 'MOH', 'date': '2021-09-09 07:00:00', 'title': 'MOLINA HEALTHCARE SIGNS CEO JOE ZUBRETSKY TO NEW EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT', 'text': "LONG BEACH, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOLINA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE: MOH) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AMENDED AND RESTATED EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT WITH ITS PRESIDENT AND CEO, JOE ZUBRETSKY. THE CHAIRMAN OF MOLINA'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS, DALE WOLF, SAID, “DURING HIS NEARLY FOUR-YEAR TENURE, JOE HAS LED THE SUCCESSFUL TURNAROUND OF MOLINA. AND HE IS NOW EXECUTING ON OUR TOP-LINE GROWTH PLAN WITH THE SAME TENACITY AND INSIGHT. WE ARE DELIGHTED TO HAVE HIM LEADING THE COMPANY.” ZUBRETSKY,"}